on": "Master drone flying in minutes\u2014no crashes, no consequences.\nMR Drone Simulator: Learn to Fly is a beginner-friendly mixed reality simulator built for Meta Quest. It blends your real-world surroundings with immersive training missions, teaching you how to fly a virtual drone safely and confidently.\nWhether you're a new drone owner, a student, or just curious about drone tech, this is the perfect starting point.\n Key Features:\nMixed Reality Training: Fly a virtual drone in your own space using passthrough\n\n\nStep-by-Step Lessons: Start with takeoff, hovering, and safe landings\n\n\nRealistic Controls: Master pitch, roll, yaw, and throttle with intuitive inputs\n\n\nImmersive Practice Environments: Overlay your room with training zones, targets, and obstacles\n\n\nProgress Tracking: Earn badges and advance through beginner levels\n\n\nThis is your risk-free, crash-proof launchpad to the skies.\n", "short_description": "Learn drone flying basics with mixed reality training in your real space.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.pastelcube.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Pastelcube Technologies private limited", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.pastelcube.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "i